{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"openURL","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenURLAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV7openURLAA0A9URLActionVvp","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"title":"openURL","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/openURL","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"openURL"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI0A9URLActionV","text":"OpenURLAction"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Read this environment value to get an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance for a given ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". Call the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance to open a URL. You call the instance directly because it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defines a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" method that Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calls when you call the instance.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you can open a web site when the user taps a button:"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["struct OpenURLExample: View {","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openURL","","    var body: some View {","        Button {","            if let url = URL(string: \"https:\/\/www.example.com\") {","                openURL(url)","            }","        } label: {","            Label(\"Get Help\", systemImage: \"person.fill.questionmark\")","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to know whether the action succeeds, add a completion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handler that takes a Boolean value. In this case, Swift implicitly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"calls the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/callAsFunction(_:completion:)","isActive":true},{"text":" method","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead. That method calls your completion handler after it determines","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it can open the URL, but possibly before it finishes opening","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the URL. You can add a handler to the example above so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it prints the outcome to the console:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["openURL(url) { accepted in","    print(accepted ? \"Success\" : \"Failure\")","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system provides a default open URL action with behavior"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that depends on the contents of the URL. For example, the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action opens a Universal Link in the associated app if possible,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or in the user’s default web browser if not."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can also set a custom action using the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/View\/environment(_:_:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view modifier. Any views that read the action from the environment,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including the built-in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Link"},{"text":" view and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text"},{"text":" views with markdown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"links, or links in attributed strings, use your action. Initialize an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"action by calling the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/init(handler:)"},{"text":" initializer with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a handler that takes a URL and returns an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["Text(\"Visit [Example Company](https:\/\/www.example.com) for details.\")","    .environment(\\.openURL, OpenURLAction { url in","        handleURL(url) \/\/ Define this method to take appropriate action.","        return .handled","    })"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftUI translates the value that your custom action’s handler","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns into an appropriate Boolean result for the action call.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, a view that uses the action declared above","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receives ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when calling the action, because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handler always returns ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result\/handled","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/openurl"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"An action that opens a URL.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/OpenURLAction/Result":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Result"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Result"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"OpenURLAction.Result","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/OpenURLAction\/Result","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The result of a custom open URL action."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/openurlaction\/result"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnvironmentValues","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"OpenSwiftUI exposes a collection of values to your app’s views in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"EnvironmentValues","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" structure. To read a value from the structure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"declare a property using the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation